  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase">
    <defName>Stalker_Apparel_Exoskeleton</defName>
    <label>Exoskeleton</label>
    <description>An experimental model of a military exoskeleton. It was not put into serial production due to its extremely high cost price and some design flaws. Despite this, it is produced in small batches at underground enterprises outside of Ukraine. This exoskeleton belongs to the third generation. It eliminates many of the previous shortcomings that dramatically reduced mobility, and also strengthens the armor. The exoskeleton perfectly protects the owner from bullet and shrapnel damage, but significantly reduces the degree of mobility. We penetrate with an armor-piercing bullet.</description>
